  "instrument": "scripts/golden_snapshot.py compare <baseline> --report <path>",
  "the_qualifying_ten": "Four cast_timeline[1]/resource_cost leaves, 0.0 -> 60.0, transition zero_to_value; four resource_spent leaves, 530.0 -> 590.0, +11.32%; and the two pair-snapshot keys, transition absent_to_value. The other 58 coupled leaves are the same 60.0 walking down the mana ledger -- every one a value transition under 4.8% on a leaf carrying no damage token, which is R-15's own reading and not a waiver."
 },
